{'symbol': 'GS', 'date': '2022-01-06 09:00:00', 'title': "BARINGS PROVIDES FINANCING FOR GOLDMAN SACHS ASSET MANAGEMENT'S ACQUISITION OF THE COVE", 'text': "CHARLOTTE, N.C., JAN. 6, 2022 /PRNEWSWIRE/ --\xa0BARINGS, ONE OF THE WORLD'S LEADING INVESTMENT MANAGERS, ANNOUNCED TODAY THAT IT HAS PROVIDED A $76.9 MILLION FINANCING PACKAGE FOR THE REAL ESTATE BUSINESS WITHIN GOLDMAN SACHS ASSET MANAGEMENT (GOLDMAN SACHS) ACQUISITION OF THE COVE, A 220-UNIT, BEST-IN-CLASS SUBURBAN APARTMENT COMMUNITY IN HINGHAM, MA."}